  "visualBrief": "A pale concrete oval with a large spectator cutaway, projecting roof ribs, stepped red seating, painted basketball markings and miniature spectators. Street and close-up models show raised red backs and three recessed entrances in the lower seating. Yellow tread edges mark the aisles beside the end recesses, and the close-up adds slender rails. A dark blue skirt borders a concrete apron around the raised court. Street and close-up add the inset court markings and straight returns from the arcs to the baselines. Green frames support the baskets. The entrance wings have recessed-looking window grilles, blue steel gates and low planted beds. The viewing cutaway has blue-gray cheeks and a slender upper crossbar. At close range, nested square inlays mark the entrance landing.",
